    description: "tranche-05 chunk-1 discovery (pass 81 / F81.A1; preserved per operator after the run was stopped to fix methodology). All 16301 edges with meta.resolution_quality='type_inferred' are is_resolved=false, confidence=0.4, quality.reason='low_confidence_fallback', Python-only, with synthetic ':unresolved' dst placeholders; 0/16301 actually resolved. Spec §9 (~line 817) defines resolution_quality as recording whether the receiver type was inferred precisely, by name only, or NOT AT ALL — this population is the 'not at all' case yet labeled 'type_inferred'. Producer: packages/hypergumbo-lang-mainstream/src/hypergumbo_lang_mainstream/py.py:3648-3665 (else-branch whose own comment says 'type cannot be inferred'). Reproduced fresh. Evidence: agent_notes ledger + dogfood_tranche_05/pass_81.md."  # 7191
